A field access directly on `bit_cast(@S, p)` fails to compile with the LLVM backend: IR-gen tags the field base with the struct type by overwriting the bit_cast's TypeArg (its target type), so codegen emits `ptrtoint i8* to %S` (claude-todo.md MAJOR "field access directly on bit_cast"). The native-arm32 modes inherit the arm32 markers.
